Note: ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
Note: Syl Core Standard Library v1.4
Note: ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
Note: Provides fundamental runtime utilities for all Syl programs.
Note: This module is automatically available as a virtual import.
Note: ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

Note: ─── Identity ───────────────────────────────────────────

Define an action called "version" that does:
    Return "1.4.0".

Define an action called "lang" that does:
    Return "Syl".

Note: ─── Type Conversion ──────────────────────────────────────

Define an action called "to_string" taking value that does:
    Return value joined with "".

Note: ─── String Utilities ─────────────────────────────────────

Define an action called "greet" taking name that does:
    Set msg to "Hello, " joined with name.
    Return msg.

Note: ─── Assertions ───────────────────────────────────────────

Define an action called "assert_not_empty" taking value and label that does:
    Enforce value is not empty or crash with label.
    Return value.

Note: ─── Logging ──────────────────────────────────────────────

Define an action called "log" taking message that does:
    Print "[LOG] " joined with message.

Define an action called "warn" taking message that does:
    Print "[WARN] " joined with message.

Define an action called "error" taking message that does:
    Print "[ERROR] " joined with message.
